data conformance_imports_only_dissolution_note: String = "Parallel import envelope of coproduct_reflection_conformance_test.dag for B2 reference-closure witnesses: v2 parse_module rejects test fn bodies today, so equivalence gates use this pipeline-parseable stub. Dissolves when parse_module accepts fn bodies (repoint conformance_entry witnesses to src/v2/test/claim/manual/coproduct_reflection_conformance_test.dag) or when a shared import-envelope fixture subsumes both."

